# Protección si algún día se sirve con Apache (GitHub Pages ignora este archivo).
Options -Indexes -MultiViews
ServerSignature Off
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header always set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow, noarchive, noimageindex"
  Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
  Header always set X-Frame-Options "SAMEORIGIN"
  Header always set Referrer-Policy "no-referrer"
  Header always set Permissions-Policy "geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()"
</IfModule>
<FilesMatch "(^\.|\.(md|mjs|log|jks|bak|sh|gradle)$|^LICENSE$)">
  Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
<FilesMatch "^(LÉEME|README)\.md$">
  Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
